00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.380
The Farmer and the Renewed Resolve

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:42.500
I missed you, Onii-chan.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.630
I-Ilvia...?

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.170
Well?

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.880
I've become pretty since last you saw me, right?

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.540
You know, I came wearing my most favorite outfit,
just for this day.

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:56.630
How?

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.920
You're supposed to have died...

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.670
I'm like this now...

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.670
thanks to the great Evil God!

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.460
You know, the great Evil God is amazing!

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:24.790
It can swallow up just about all of
this world's sorrows and sufferings.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.080
Look.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:29.460
This...

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.460
is the great Evil God's power...

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:37.960
Yuria!

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:02.710
This can't be...

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.790
A world like this...

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.210
You know, I can easily destroy it.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:16.380
But the fact you were able to keep up with
the speed of my attack...

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.670
you really are amazing after all.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:24.380
Even though the power of the great Evil God
inside of your body is still sealed away.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.380
The power of the Evil God?

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:31.290
Onii-chan, you know how you attained
the "One who loves nature" skill

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.380
and your stats increased significantly?

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:36.790
Huh?

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:42.830
"You have evolved into a true lover of nature.
Now receive the grace of the earth."

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:43.880
Wait, what's that?

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:46.210
Hey, look at your attack power!

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:48.330
It's turned into a tremendous number!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.500
You're right...

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.880
You know, that's the great Evil God's skill.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.880
That can't be...

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:02.000
Well, I'm sure you would've been strong
with just your original powers too, but...

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:04.380
Hang on!

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.210
Why would the Evil God do that to me?!

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:07.670
In the first place, I've never even met-

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.000
You've met it.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.130
What?

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.920
If you come over to our side,

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:16.380
then I'll tell you more properly.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.630
Okay, Onii-chan?

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.880
Let's live together again, like before.

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:30.750
I... will...

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:32.170
No!

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.380
Onii-chan!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.290
Don't interfere, will ya?!

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.290
Stop it...

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:45.790
He's my big brother, you know?!

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:49.290
Ilvia! Stop!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:57.130
Onii-chan, if you say you'll accept
the great Evil God's power,

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:00.670
then I suppose I can at least spare
your loved ones...

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:04.670
But if you say you won't accept it, then...

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.170
Yuria!

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:14.210
O..Onii-chan... Don't worry about me...

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.710
Run!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.830
You're still trying to interfere?

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.960
Well, in that case...

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:23.210
Die.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.210
Don't!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.580
Huh?

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:46.210
Ilvia?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.630
What in the world is this?

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.040
What's happening?

00:05:59.000 --> 00:05:59.880
I am sorry that I have startled you...

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.080
Whoa! What the heck?!
I am sorry that I have startled you...

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:01.960
I am sorry that I have startled you...

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:11.420
Who are you?

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:13.130
Al Wayne.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.130
Hello.

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:17.830
And you are?

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:20.960
Ah, my apologies.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:23.290
I had not introduced myself yet.

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:26.670
I am what you and the others call the Good God.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:28.880
The Good God?

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:32.130
I had been obstructed by the Evil God
for the longest time,

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:37.960
but by using that pendant as a catalyst,
I have finally been able to link space-time together.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.540
I have stopped time with my power...

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.830
That being said, it will not last long.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:51.920
It is a little forced, but I will eradicate
the Evil God's power that is inside of you,

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.210
and grant my power to you.

00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:57.670
Power? What does that...?

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.920
I see the Evil God has become aware of this...

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:07.290
Before we are obstructed,
please give me your hand...

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.040
This is...

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:20.000
Although it is incomplete,

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.830
if you have this power, then you should be able
to block your opponent's moves.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:25.580
Also...

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:29.210
I will try to turn back time just a little bit.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:31.580
With that, please save that little girl.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:33.080
Understood.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.130
I appreciate it, Al Wayne.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:40.460
May you drive back the Evil God's progression...

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.130
You're still trying to interfere?

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:50.330
Well, in that case...

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:51.580
I won't let you!

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.330
That power is...!

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:06.880
The Good God must've intervened.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.880
But that's a rather lame skill-

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.460
What?!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.750
What's up with this?!

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.670
It's true that I can't destroy this bushgiller, but....

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:23.330
If I do this...

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.210
See?

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:31.710
They can easily be torn apart.

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:33.670
You're too soft, you know?

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:38.420
If you think you can stop me, then...

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.170
Go ahead, try!

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:46.540
Protect!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.170
I see.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.630
I guess there is this kind of way to use them too...

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:55.710
You never learn, do you?

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:02.710
Yuria-sama!

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:06.130
You there, continue to keep that woman restrained!

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:07.750
Volpe Dohma!

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:10.830
I will not let you lay a hand on Yuria-sama!

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:19.880
Yuria-sama, are you injured?

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.250
No, I'm fine.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.670
Thank goodness.

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:26.170
Volpe Dohma, I see you're back to normal.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.540
How insolent...

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:36.290
But you see, that didn't affect me at all.
Too bad for you.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:40.670
Volpe Dohma!

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:46.920
That's enough!

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:47.920
Ilvia!

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:59.580
It's kinda gotten boring suddenly.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:01.670
Ilvia...

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:03.630
Aw!

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:06.250
And I'd liked this outfit...

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.830
But there are too many jerks getting in my way...

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.460
I'm gonna go now.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.710
Wait a minute!

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:15.250
Next time, let's meet up, just the two of us.

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.040
Onii-chan.

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:30.880
You bastard! What's the meaning of this?!

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.880
What's your relationship with that woman?!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:35.040
You might suffer depending on your answer.

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.210
Volpe Dohma, stop it!

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:40.210
He's the one who protected me, you know!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:42.000
But, Yuria-sama...

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:44.210
Enough, Volpe Dohma.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:47.500
Your Majesty.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:52.670
For Yuria and everyone,
it doesn't change the fact that he saved us.

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.420
My apologies.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.630
Please forgive my subordinate's discourtesy.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.630
Not at all...

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:02.130
However... Who the hell was that?

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:09.290
She is my younger sister...

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:12.750
The Evil God...

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:14.880
Do you know anything about it?

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:17.540
No... I'm sorry.

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:21.580
I only know that it was involved
with my ancestor, but...

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:26.670
You see, all the books pertaining to it
were expunged.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.330
I see...

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:32.630
If I find out anything, then I will contact you immediately.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.540
Yes, please...

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:36.330
Onii-chan...

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:37.380
Huh?

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:39.080
You're going already?

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:40.380
Yeah.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.580
Will we meet again?

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.210
Of course we'll meet again.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:57.170
What's with you?!

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.420
Hold your tongue!

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:00.920
You intend to seduce Yuria-sama!

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.130
Such irreverence!

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:04.630
You deserve to die ten thousand deaths!

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:08.210
Volpe Dohma...

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.710
I think that misunderstanding of yours
is what deserves to die ten thousand deaths.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.210
Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:17.210
I would never do such a...

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:20.960
My master! Yuria-sama!

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:26.500
Ilvia, just what exactly are you...

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:34.460
Excuse me.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:38.710
Fal-sama, are you going out?

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:39.880
Yes.

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:46.630
Albie, I'm sorry that I always ask you to act
as my body double, when I go out...

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:48.290
Not at all.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:52.000
After all, knowing about the people
is also an important job for you, Fal-sama.

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:55.880
If there is anyway I can be of use,
then please let me know.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.460
Thank you.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.500
You're really helpful.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.250
Well then, I'm headed off.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:19.710
Onii-chan, you know how you attained the
"One who loves nature" skill,

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.580
and your stats increased significantly?

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:24.580
You know, that's the great Evil God's skill.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:25.580
Hang on!

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.420
Why would the Evil God do that to me?!

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:29.080
In the first place, I've never even met-

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.290
You've met it.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:33.880
I wonder what she meant by that...

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:36.580
The one thing I can possibly think of is...

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.210
There's something written on it.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.460
What language is that?

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:54.210
That time... The thing I met was the Evil God?

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:58.250
If I ask Testa, who was with me,
I might be able to find out something...

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:04.710
Testa!

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:06.330
Hey! Testa!

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:09.210
Yo! Al!

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.880
Something like that happened?!

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.210
Yeah...

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.710
It's kinda unbelievable, you know?

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.500
Hey, Testa.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.540
You know how we explored
a cave a long time ago?

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.170
Yeah, we did.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:30.000
I lost consciousness that time,
so my memory is fuzzy on that, but...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:34.000
I might've seen something, or rather,
I feel like I met something and...

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.000
What kind of something? What was it?

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:39.500
You didn't see anything after all?

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:43.130
That day you suddenly crashed
and passed out,

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:45.500
and also the volcano erupted...

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.750
You know it was pandemonium after that.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.880
Yeah, that's right.

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:51.750
Is something wrong?

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.580
Do you know about the Evil God?

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:55.460
What?

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:57.290
Oh, never mind.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.790
More importantly, how were the tomatas?

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:00.880
Oh, yeah!

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:05.250
When I used the nigari as fertilizer like you said to,
they grew into extremely delicious ones.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:06.580
See.

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:11.960
Yeah! Yum!

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:12.960
Right?

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:15.960
I'm sorry about you taking care of my fields.

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:19.290
It's not just me, everyone in the village
is caring for them, too.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.500
Oh yeah, Testa.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:24.040
Come over to the royal capital
to hang out once in a while.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.670
Yeah, as much as I'd like to go...

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:30.250
I have my job as a fisherman, so...

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:31.920
I see...

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:33.500
Yeah, you're right.

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:35.460
Well, maybe next time.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.540
Yeah.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.460
Be careful heading back!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:47.630
Al, I was happy you invited me, but...

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.460
You see, I can't leave here...

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.210
Aw...

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.960
This is a shortcut, but...

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.080
How depressing...

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:18.580
But... Even I have gotten somewhat
used to this already!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.130
Take that!

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.500
Huh? What? Huh?!

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:34.580
What? It didn't work?

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:36.000
Why?!

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:41.500
Full Power Swing!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.080
You okay?

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.830
You must really be liked by orcs.

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:52.880
Whereas I am liked
by the girls in the royal capital.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.380
I mean, really, I'm too popular that it's troublesome.

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:56.080
Hey, Alutchi, have you like gotten weaker?
I mean, really, I'm too popular that it's troublesome.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.500
Hey, Alutchi, have you like gotten weaker?

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.500
What?

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:03.750
Alutchi, you're battle-hardened, so, isn't it odd
that you're still having trouble dealing with orcs?

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.540
You're not good against orcs, right?

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:14.540
So...

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:15.250
What? You couldn't defeat an orc? You, Al?

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:17.670
Are you listening to my story?
What? You couldn't defeat an orc? You, Al?

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:18.290
What? You couldn't defeat an orc? You, Al?

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:23.460
You really aren't compatible with orcs...
Or maybe, you are?

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:25.670
That's not what it is...

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:28.040
It's definitely strange.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:31.750
Someone with your strength
should be able to repel them with one blow...

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.290
By any chance, were you taken
by surprise or something?

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:38.790
No, this time I went for a head-on fight, but...

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:43.420
I can't believe that an orc
was able to block Al's punch though.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:46.170
Jake and the others told me that too.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:51.500
Al-kun, would you show me
your stat screen for a sec?

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.080
What? Oh, sure...

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.210
I thought so...

00:17:57.210 --> 00:18:00.250
Your stats have gone down considerably
compared to before.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:01.380
It's true...

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:07.630
Maybe the cause is because I lost the
"One who loves nature" skill...

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:11.460
I will eradicate the Evil God's power
that is inside of you,

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:13.580
and grant my power to you.

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:18.210
Al-kun.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.460
Al-kun?

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:21.960
Oh! Yes?

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:24.250
Did something come to mind?

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:27.710
I don't want to make them worry unnecessarily.

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.500
I'll tell everyone after I've investigated it...

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.000
No... Not particularly...

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:36.250
I see... That being said, don't worry.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:41.000
Your stats are still much higher
than the average for an adventurer.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.380
Oh, is that so?

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:44.790
Let's do our best together on the quests, Al!

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:46.290
Yeah, sure.

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:49.750
Al-san! So, this is where you were.

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:51.500
Hey, Reaks.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:52.580
Hey.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:55.500
I've come to deliver the mail.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.750
From Mom again, huh?

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:00.460
Maybe it's some urgent business?

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:03.540
"Al, I adore you. I love you."

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:04.920
You can ignore that part.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:10.420
"By the way, when you are reading this letter,
are those two you-know-who girls together with you?"

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:13.330
By any chance, is your mom
watching from somewhere or something?

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:16.540
After all, she is the former commander
of the "Shadow Puppets"!

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.380
"If you make a move on Al...

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:20.420
You know what that means, right?"

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:25.170
I'm too scared to read any further!

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:28.170
It's okay, you don't need to be that afraid.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:32.670
It seems like you went through a lot
of tough times, but...

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:36.420
There are still many things
that haven't reached my ears yet too.

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:39.000
I'll investigate over on my end too...

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:43.790
At any rate, if you have any trouble
with something, you can always tell me.

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:46.580
Also, you can always come home.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.080
I'll be waiting.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:52.630
Al, I love you with all my heart.

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:55.580
I really, really, really, really, really, really,
really love you!

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:59.460
It's true. No matter what anyone says,
no, more than anyone, I-

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:03.880
You're not going to write a reply?

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:05.330
Uh, some other time.

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:07.000
Well, see ya.

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:09.040
Oops! Sorry about that.

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:10.920
I'm sorry too.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.580
Al-kun!

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:15.080
Filia.

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:18.330
Hey, since it's been a while,
I want you to hang out with me for a bit.

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.080
What?

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.920
What?! That's not fair, Filia!

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:22.880
It's been a while for me too, you know!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:23.580
Hang on!

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:26.630
I haven't finished talking with him.

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:27.920
What? Really?

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.630
Grr... Grrr!

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.170
C'mon, you three...

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:35.790
Hey! Alutchi! Hurry up and c'mere!

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:36.920
Everyone's waiting-

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.750
Could you not interfere!

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.750
Oh, no... I mean... Sorry!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:47.250
Why was Ilvia alive?

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:50.630
Why did she make an appearance before me?

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:55.040
Just what exactly is the Evil God?
What is its connection to the demonkind?

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:57.250
There's still a lot of things I don't know...

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:03.250
But for me right now, I have Fal and Ruri,
Helen-san, and my friends in the guild...

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:08.130
For the sake of my friends,

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:10.000
and for the sake of Meigis...

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:17.000
As a farmer, I will grow lots of good vegetables!

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:25.710
I am Fal-Ys Meigis.

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:26.920
Nice to meet you.

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:28.380
I'm Helen.

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:30.040
Helen Rean.

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:31.500
I'm Ruri.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:33.170
Nice to meet you, Al-kun!

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:34.960
Hey!

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.420
Al!

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:46.830
Also, as an adventurer too,
I'm thinking of improving my skills more and more!

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:59.460
Onii-chan... I'll be waiting for you.

